OL,3,ABikes 'not for jousting,' says Lime
OL,4,Aafter duel video
OL,5,
OL,6,FE-bike rental company Lime has said its
OL,7,Fbikes are "not for jousting" after
OL,8,Ffootage of two riders dressed as
OL,9,Fknights charging at each other in an
OL,10,Feast London park circulated over the
OL,11,Fweekend.
OL,13,FHundreds of people congregated in
OL,14,FLondon Fields, Hackney, to watch artist
OL,15,FJack Carden and actor Camtholomew the
OL,16,FFirst joust, while riding the bright
OL,17,Fgreen rentable e-bikes.
OL,19,FThe videos on social media showed them
OL,20,Fdressed as knights in armour, complete
OL,21,Fwith chainmail and lances, attempting
OL,22,Fto knock each other off the bikes.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
